OL,3,AWarm words on Canada's EU 'associate
OL,4,Amembership' but no guarantees
OL,5,
OL,6,FIs Canada about to join the EU?
OL,7,FHeadlines across Europe indicate a lot
OL,8,Fof confusion right now.
OL,10,FThe EU constitution rules that
OL,11,Fpossibility out as Canada is
OL,12,Fgeographically outside Europe.
OL,14,FBut in a speech on Thursday to the
OL,15,FEuropean Parliament, Canada's Prime
OL,16,FMinister Mark Carney said: "Canada and
OL,17,FEurope should secure our strategic
OL,18,Fautonomy through deep cooperation in
OL,19,Fthe full range of strategic
OL,20,Fcapabilities."
